{"id":"66c9470f107a6bad","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-zfc.md","title":"ZFC Set Theory","display":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-zfc","aliases":["92-df-zfc"],"display":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-zfc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-zfc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{AC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{AC}\\)</span> (Zermelo-Fraenkel axiom set and Choice axiom; aligned with Book 58)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span> (definition-target local alias)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ZFC：标准集合论</li>\n<li>Zermelo-Fraenkel + 选择公理</li>\n<li>数学的基础</li>\n<li>ZFC递归可公理化</li>\n<li>若 ZFC 一致，则其递归可公理化性和足够的算术强度使 Gödel 不完备性定理适用，故存在它不能判定的算术句</li>\n<li>若 ZFC 一致，则在标准可证性编码下，第二不完备性定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})\\)</span></li>\n<li>大基数公理扩展ZFC</li>\n<li>集论的不完备性更复杂</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{AC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92})","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$ (countable transitive set with $M\\models_{\\in}\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$, see [[92-df-zfc]])"},{"id":"fef4cc51fd3a44b5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$ (local ZFC theory, see [[92-df-zfc]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe